[{:db/id "c1ed43f6-4855-52a9-a384-1d599ac85543" :answer/id #uuid "c1ed43f6-4855-52a9-a384-1d599ac85543" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2 - 52 \\pi" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "69684ec4-4be0-5868-aff3-3fed587c9d86" :answer/id #uuid "69684ec4-4be0-5868-aff3-3fed587c9d86" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "52 \\pi" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "b55dff06-4093-5a7d-8247-97e5471839db" :answer/id #uuid "b55dff06-4093-5a7d-8247-97e5471839db" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-2" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "688533d7-da94-5d62-886b-1a90ca349e53" :answer/id #uuid "688533d7-da94-5d62-886b-1a90ca349e53" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-2 + 52 \\pi" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "a0e57cc0-e23e-5364-8631-e13e2e412ba6" :answer/id #uuid "a0e57cc0-e23e-5364-8631-e13e2e412ba6" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "- 52 \\pi - 2" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "a297ede3-80df-5c9e-a44a-147e80cb4715" :answer-field/id #uuid "a297ede3-80df-5c9e-a44a-147e80cb4715" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/choices ["c1ed43f6-4855-52a9-a384-1d599ac85543" "69684ec4-4be0-5868-aff3-3fed587c9d86" "b55dff06-4093-5a7d-8247-97e5471839db" "688533d7-da94-5d62-886b-1a90ca349e53" "a0e57cc0-e23e-5364-8631-e13e2e412ba6"] :answer-field/correct "688533d7-da94-5d62-886b-1a90ca349e53" :db/ensure :answer-field/validate} {:db/id "f3771e2f-30a0-504d-a491-225f9ef42173" :question/id #uuid "f3771e2f-30a0-504d-a491-225f9ef42173" :question/problem "If the path $C$ is a part of the graph $y=3 \\pi x^{2}$ traversed from the point $A(1,3 \\pi)$ to point $B(3,27 \\pi),$ then ${\\int }_C\\left(\\sin{\\left(\\frac{y}{2 x^{2}} \\right)}\\right)\\,dx+\\left(x\\right)\\,dy=$" :question/worked-solution "Notice that our curve is given by the explicit Cartesian equation $y=3 \\pi x^{2}.$ As a result, we obtain the following parametrization of the curve:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}r(t)=x(t)\\,i+y(t)\\,j=\\left(t\\right)\\,i+\\left(3 \\pi t^{2}\\right)\\,j,\\,t\\in [1,3]\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe derivative of $r(t)$ is given by\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{r}^{′}(t)&=\\frac{\\text{d}x}{\\text{d}t}\\,i+\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}t}\\,j=\\left(1\\right)\\,i+\\left(6 \\pi t\\right)\\,j.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe can now evaluate the line integral:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_C\\left(\\sin{\\left(\\frac{y}{2 x^{2}} \\right)}\\right)\\,dx+\\left(x\\right)\\,dy &={\\int }_{1}^{3}\\left(\\sin{\\left(\\frac{y}{2 x^{2}} \\right)}\\right)\\frac{\\text{d}x}{\\text{d}t}\\,\\text{d}t+\\left(x\\right)\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}t}\\,\\text{d}t \\\\  &={\\int }_{1}^{3}\\left(\\left(\\sin{\\left(\\frac{y}{2 x^{2}} \\right)}\\right)\\frac{\\text{d}x}{\\text{d}t}+\\left(x\\right)\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}t}\\right)\\,dt \\\\  &={\\int }_{1}^{3}\\left(\\sin{\\left(\\frac{\\left(3 \\pi t^{2}\\right)}{2 \\left(t\\right)^{2}} \\right)}\\right)\\cdot \\left(1\\right)+\\left(\\left(t\\right)\\right)\\cdot \\left(6 \\pi t\\right)\\,dt \\\\  &={\\int }_{1}^{3}-1+6 \\pi t^{2}\\,dt \\\\  &={\\int }_{1}^{3}6 \\pi t^{2} - 1\\,dt \\\\  &=\\left[- t+2 \\pi t^{3}\\right]_{1}^{3} \\\\  &=[- \\left(3\\right)+2 \\pi \\left(3\\right)^{3}]-[- \\left(1\\right)+2 \\pi \\left(1\\right)^{3}] \\\\  &=[-3+54 \\pi]-[-1+2 \\pi] \\\\  &=-2 + 52 \\pi\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard :question/answer-fields ["a297ede3-80df-5c9e-a44a-147e80cb4715"] :db/ensure :question/validate} {:db/id "779fd53c-1281-543d-924b-41becda0bec5" :answer/id #uuid "779fd53c-1281-543d-924b-41becda0bec5" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "- \\frac{8}{5}" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "2b805d00-fa7e-59e2-bf53-fb6bd5ba499b" :answer/id #uuid "2b805d00-fa7e-59e2-bf53-fb6bd5ba499b" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{312}{5}" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "02aa9a57-14fb-5da2-89a8-c60019da0740" :answer/id #uuid "02aa9a57-14fb-5da2-89a8-c60019da0740" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "64" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "93528aed-dc54-5dab-bbaa-d4d103cae7a2" :answer/id #uuid "93528aed-dc54-5dab-bbaa-d4d103cae7a2" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "- \\frac{328}{5}" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "3f647e58-0307-54fb-91d2-41df1d42abcd" :answer/id #uuid "3f647e58-0307-54fb-91d2-41df1d42abcd" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "- \\frac{312}{5}" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "e58510c5-ac6e-51f9-868d-1d0c4dc0f95a" :answer-field/id #uuid "e58510c5-ac6e-51f9-868d-1d0c4dc0f95a" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/choices ["779fd53c-1281-543d-924b-41becda0bec5" "2b805d00-fa7e-59e2-bf53-fb6bd5ba499b" "02aa9a57-14fb-5da2-89a8-c60019da0740" "93528aed-dc54-5dab-bbaa-d4d103cae7a2" "3f647e58-0307-54fb-91d2-41df1d42abcd"] :answer-field/correct "2b805d00-fa7e-59e2-bf53-fb6bd5ba499b" :db/ensure :answer-field/validate} {:db/id "7162142b-dbd1-534f-9062-4b9d8572ca7b" :question/id #uuid "7162142b-dbd1-534f-9062-4b9d8572ca7b" :question/problem "If the path $C$ is a part of the graph $y=x^{2} - 3$ traversed from the point $A(0,-3)$ to point $B(2,1),$ then ${\\int }_C\\left(x^{2} y\\right)\\,dx+\\left(3 x^{2} \\left(y + 3\\right)\\right)\\,dy=$" :question/worked-solution "Notice that our curve is given by the explicit Cartesian equation $y=x^{2} - 3.$ As a result, we obtain the following parametrization of the curve:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}r(t)=x(t)\\,i+y(t)\\,j=\\left(t\\right)\\,i+\\left(t^{2} - 3\\right)\\,j,\\,t\\in [0,2]\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe derivative of $r(t)$ is given by\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{r}^{′}(t)&=\\frac{\\text{d}x}{\\text{d}t}\\,i+\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}t}\\,j=\\left(1\\right)\\,i+\\left(2 t\\right)\\,j.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe can now evaluate the line integral:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_C\\left(x^{2} y\\right)\\,dx+\\left(3 x^{2} \\left(y + 3\\right)\\right)\\,dy &={\\int }_{0}^{2}\\left(x^{2} y\\right)\\frac{\\text{d}x}{\\text{d}t}\\,\\text{d}t+\\left(3 x^{2} \\left(y + 3\\right)\\right)\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}t}\\,\\text{d}t \\\\  &={\\int }_{0}^{2}\\left(\\left(x^{2} y\\right)\\frac{\\text{d}x}{\\text{d}t}+\\left(3 x^{2} \\left(y + 3\\right)\\right)\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}t}\\right)\\,dt \\\\  &={\\int }_{0}^{2}\\left(\\left(t\\right)^{2} \\left(t^{2} - 3\\right)\\right)\\cdot \\left(1\\right)+\\left(3 \\left(t\\right)^{2} \\left(\\left(t^{2} - 3\\right) + 3\\right)\\right)\\cdot \\left(2 t\\right)\\,dt \\\\  &={\\int }_{0}^{2}t^{4} - 3 t^{2}+6 t^{5}\\,dt \\\\  &={\\int }_{0}^{2}6 t^{5} + t^{4} - 3 t^{2}\\,dt \\\\  &=\\left[\\frac{t^{5}}{5}- t^{3}+t^{6}\\right]_{0}^{2} \\\\  &=[\\frac{\\left(2\\right)^{5}}{5}- \\left(2\\right)^{3}+\\left(2\\right)^{6}]-[\\frac{\\left(0\\right)^{5}}{5}- \\left(0\\right)^{3}+\\left(0\\right)^{6}] \\\\  &=[\\frac{32}{5}-8+64]-[0+0+0] \\\\  &=\\frac{312}{5}\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard :question/answer-fields ["e58510c5-ac6e-51f9-868d-1d0c4dc0f95a"] :db/ensure :question/validate} {:db/id "e66cffba-5fe7-572d-8b46-9c663c477ab7" :answer/id #uuid "e66cffba-5fe7-572d-8b46-9c663c477ab7" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-2" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "ae0dfcc4-e263-550a-a347-77b9c856215f" :answer/id #uuid "ae0dfcc4-e263-550a-a347-77b9c856215f" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-2 + 24 \\pi" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "e88587d0-0436-5fed-93df-1882ec786690" :answer/id #uuid "e88587d0-0436-5fed-93df-1882ec786690" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "24 \\pi" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "f931f17f-cdad-528e-9767-25b179cb2cab" :answer/id #uuid "f931f17f-cdad-528e-9767-25b179cb2cab" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "- 24 \\pi - 2" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "d81332bf-adb8-5841-99d3-9d72d8bfcb57" :answer/id #uuid "d81332bf-adb8-5841-99d3-9d72d8bfcb57" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2 - 24 \\pi" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "3f453c7f-8458-5c6f-9e7d-b329ad3c557e" :answer-field/id #uuid "3f453c7f-8458-5c6f-9e7d-b329ad3c557e" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/choices ["e66cffba-5fe7-572d-8b46-9c663c477ab7" "ae0dfcc4-e263-550a-a347-77b9c856215f" "e88587d0-0436-5fed-93df-1882ec786690" "f931f17f-cdad-528e-9767-25b179cb2cab" "d81332bf-adb8-5841-99d3-9d72d8bfcb57"] :answer-field/correct "ae0dfcc4-e263-550a-a347-77b9c856215f" :db/ensure :answer-field/validate} {:db/id "3c5590c4-444c-5199-8159-57617b0360a9" :question/id #uuid "3c5590c4-444c-5199-8159-57617b0360a9" :question/problem "If the path $C$ is a part of the graph $y=3 \\pi x^{2}$ traversed from the point $A(0,0)$ to point $B(2,12 \\pi),$ then ${\\int }_C\\left(\\cos{\\left(\\frac{y}{x^{2}} \\right)}\\right)\\,dx+\\left(x^{2}\\right)\\,dy=$ The composed integrand at the initial endpoint is interpreted by its one-sided continuous extension along $C.$" :question/worked-solution "Notice that our curve is given by the explicit Cartesian equation $y=3 \\pi x^{2}.$ As a result, we obtain the following parametrization of the curve:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}r(t)=x(t)\\,i+y(t)\\,j=\\left(t\\right)\\,i+\\left(3 \\pi t^{2}\\right)\\,j,\\,t\\in [0,2]\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe derivative of $r(t)$ is given by\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{r}^{′}(t)&=\\frac{\\text{d}x}{\\text{d}t}\\,i+\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}t}\\,j=\\left(1\\right)\\,i+\\left(6 \\pi t\\right)\\,j.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe can now evaluate the line integral:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_C\\left(\\cos{\\left(\\frac{y}{x^{2}} \\right)}\\right)\\,dx+\\left(x^{2}\\right)\\,dy &={\\int }_{0}^{2}\\left(\\cos{\\left(\\frac{y}{x^{2}} \\right)}\\right)\\frac{\\text{d}x}{\\text{d}t}\\,\\text{d}t+\\left(x^{2}\\right)\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}t}\\,\\text{d}t \\\\  &={\\int }_{0}^{2}\\left(\\left(\\cos{\\left(\\frac{y}{x^{2}} \\right)}\\right)\\frac{\\text{d}x}{\\text{d}t}+\\left(x^{2}\\right)\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}t}\\right)\\,dt \\\\  &={\\int }_{0}^{2}\\left(\\cos{\\left(\\frac{\\left(3 \\pi t^{2}\\right)}{\\left(t\\right)^{2}} \\right)}\\right)\\cdot \\left(1\\right)+\\left(\\left(t\\right)^{2}\\right)\\cdot \\left(6 \\pi t\\right)\\,dt \\\\  &={\\int }_{0}^{2}-1+6 \\pi t^{3}\\,dt \\\\  &={\\int }_{0}^{2}6 \\pi t^{3} - 1\\,dt \\\\  &=\\left[- t+\\frac{3 \\pi t^{4}}{2}\\right]_{0}^{2} \\\\  &=[- \\left(2\\right)+\\frac{3 \\pi \\left(2\\right)^{4}}{2}]-[- \\left(0\\right)+\\frac{3 \\pi \\left(0\\right)^{4}}{2}] \\\\  &=[-2+24 \\pi]-[0+0] \\\\  &=-2 + 24 \\pi\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard :question/answer-fields ["3f453c7f-8458-5c6f-9e7d-b329ad3c557e"] :db/ensure :question/validate} {:db/id "f398ea5b-afdb-5725-b79e-fb562909bf61" :answer/id #uuid "f398ea5b-afdb-5725-b79e-fb562909bf61" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{1}{2}" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "27339d99-5bd9-5b84-ada5-cae5e808d7a6" :answer/id #uuid "27339d99-5bd9-5b84-ada5-cae5e808d7a6" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "14" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "ff718de6-9f5f-5ab8-baf8-a79becdbbd0f" :answer/id #uuid "ff718de6-9f5f-5ab8-baf8-a79becdbbd0f" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{27}{2}" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "8d49ffbc-81e9-5a34-8fee-73754515fc69" :answer/id #uuid "8d49ffbc-81e9-5a34-8fee-73754515fc69" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-13" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "a4fee78c-32f3-53ad-8cfa-b12be696a948" :answer/id #uuid "a4fee78c-32f3-53ad-8cfa-b12be696a948" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-14" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "614c5015-0530-568c-82e0-a67fbdb96d70" :answer-field/id #uuid "614c5015-0530-568c-82e0-a67fbdb96d70" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/choices ["f398ea5b-afdb-5725-b79e-fb562909bf61" "27339d99-5bd9-5b84-ada5-cae5e808d7a6" "ff718de6-9f5f-5ab8-baf8-a79becdbbd0f" "8d49ffbc-81e9-5a34-8fee-7375451