n$$\n\nThe derivative of $r(t)$ is given by\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{r}^{′}(t)&=\\frac{\\text{d}x}{\\text{d}t}\\,i+\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}t}\\,j=\\left(1\\right)\\,i+\\left(6 t\\right)\\,j.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe can now evaluate the line integral:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_C\\left(y\\right)\\,dx+\\left(3 x\\right)\\,dy &={\\int }_{0}^{1}\\left(y\\right)\\frac{\\text{d}x}{\\text{d}t}\\,\\text{d}t+\\left(3 x\\right)\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}t}\\,\\text{d}t \\\\  &={\\int }_{0}^{1}\\left(\\left(y\\right)\\frac{\\text{d}x}{\\text{d}t}+\\left(3 x\\right)\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}t}\\right)\\,dt \\\\  &={\\int }_{0}^{1}\\left(\\left(3 t^{2}\\right)\\right)\\cdot \\left(1\\right)+\\left(3 \\left(t\\right)\\right)\\cdot \\left(6 t\\right)\\,dt \\\\  &={\\int }_{0}^{1}3 t^{2}+18 t^{2}\\,dt \\\\  &={\\int }_{0}^{1}21 t^{2}\\,dt \\\\  &=\\left[7 t^{3}\\right]_{0}^{1} \\\\  &=[7 \\left(1\\right)^{3}]-[7 \\left(0\\right)^{3}] \\\\  &=[7]-[0] \\\\  &=7\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["6a10e453-cbdd-592f-963c-b2f496e834bc"] :db/ensure :question/validate} {:db/id "7b51235b-d773-596c-8209-d2a82308a4fa" :answer/id #uuid "7b51235b-d773-596c-8209-d2a82308a4fa" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{5}{2}" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "d816469b-cf8f-520a-8f3a-7253e50e1889" :answer/id #uuid "d816469b-cf8f-520a-8f3a-7253e50e1889" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{1}{2}" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "ef0c8b07-d501-5dbf-91af-7e7ed08f35ba" :answer/id #uuid "ef0c8b07-d501-5dbf-91af-7e7ed08f35ba" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "- \\frac{5}{2}" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "9c858184-b694-5e2a-b80b-4d1a74942278" :answer/id #uuid "9c858184-b694-5e2a-b80b-4d1a74942278" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{3}{2}" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "c3ab1e7c-29cf-5323-83d8-66e7cbc02cbc" :answer/id #uuid "c3ab1e7c-29cf-5323-83d8-66e7cbc02c